<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal; no human approval and no hgm_gloss promotion. GMR English is verbatim. Snang constructions distinguish ‘looked like’ from ‘appeared’; the final collective construction is aligned once at the burning-steel example, leaving repeated explanatory wording with forest/fire unwrapped. cig car du owns ‘together’; supplied ‘sit down’ stays unwrapped. tshad mar keeps its case-inflected source form and owns ‘genuine’ or ‘valid perception(s)’; song ba light-verb realization remains unbanked. The negative med owns only the permitted negative affix in couldn't. sogs/ la sogs pa license only their closing gestures. The intermediate unrendered sogs is omitted. Source and exact occurrence proof accompany this proposal.</div>
